Files from this source deliberately NOT included:

  references/guides/wiki-ticket-and-github.md
      Removed. It is the GitHub/Confluence/PlantUML publishing guide;
      its advice is specifically wrong for Azure DevOps wikis.

  scripts/resilient_diagram.py
  scripts/mermaid_to_image.py
  scripts/extract_mermaid.py
      Removed. These depend on the Mermaid CLI (mmdc, via npm) and
      validate against modern Mermaid, which is not what Azure DevOps
      renders. Replaced by scripts/validate_ado_mermaid.py, which is
      original work.

Conceptual debt, not code:

  The authoring philosophy in SKILL.md -- node budgets, escaping reserved
  words, requiring colour contrast on classDef, deriving diagrams from
  real code rather than invention -- originates with this upstream skill.
  The text expressing it in SKILL.md is original, but the ideas are
  Rick Hightower's and are acknowledged as such.

